.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-COMPOSITOR 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-compositor
.Nd configure window effects and compositing.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It edits the configuration file used by the compositing manager that the
Lumina session starts, which controls effects such as transparency and
shadows.
The file is edited as plain text.
.Pp
Compositing can also be disabled for the session entirely.
This takes effect after the session is restarted.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-compositor
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/compton.conf
Compositing manager configuration.
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/sessionsettings.conf
Stores whether compositing is enabled.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lumina-desktop 1

